<h1><%= title %></h1>
<section class="error-container">
    <div class="error-icon">🚗💨</div>
    <div class="error-message">
        <%- message %>
    </div>
    <div class="error-humor">
        <h2>What happened?</h2>
        <p>📍 Looks like you drove <strong>wayyyy off the map</strong> — even our GPS gave up.</p>
        <p>🔧 Our mechanics are under the hood trying to fix it... probably.</p>
        <p>🦆 Unlike unicorns, this page is fictional too — it simply does not exist.</p>
        <p>⏳ If you had a flux capacitor, you could go back in time and <em>not</em> click that link.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="error-home-btn">🏠 Drive Me Home</a>
</section>